{"path":"iterator/counted_iterator/iter_swap","title":"iter_swap(std::counted_iterator)","titleHtml":"iter_swap<small>(std::counted_iterator)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator/iter_swap","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"Swaps the objects pointed to by two underlying iterators. The behavior is undefined if either x.count() or y.count() is equal to 0 .","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/indirectly_swappable\"><span class=\"kw3148\">std::<span class=\"me2\">indirectly_swappable</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> I2 <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; iter_swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> counted_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_swap\"><span class=\"kw3305\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iter_swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, y.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Swaps the objects pointed to by two underlying iterators. The behavior is undefined if either <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>.\n</p><p>The function body is equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_swap\"><span class=\"kw3305\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iter_swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, y.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>This function template  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> x, y\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> iterator adaptors to the elements to swap\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a> p<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n                q<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iterator</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> ip<span class=\"br0\">{</span>p.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iterator</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> iq<span class=\"br0\">{</span>q.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>ip <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>iq <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    iter_swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ip, iq<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// ADL</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>ip <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>iq <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a> x<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iterator</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> ix<span class=\"br0\">{</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  iter_swap(ip, ix); // error: not indirectly swappable</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1 5\n5 1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps the values of two objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap_ranges\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap_ranges</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two ranges of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/iter_swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iter_swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps the elements pointed to by two iterators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iter_swap</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> swaps the values referenced by two dereferenceable objects<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator/iter_move\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iter_move</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  casts the result of dereferencing the underlying iterator to its associated rvalue reference type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"iterator","title":"Iterator library"},{"path":"iterator/counted_iterator","title":"std::counted_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"iter_swap(std::counted_iterator)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Swaps the objects pointed to by two underlying iterators."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"x, y"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"swap","note":"swaps the values of two objects"},{"label":"swap_ranges","note":"swaps two ranges of elements"},{"label":"iter_swap","note":"swaps the elements pointed to by two iterators"},{"label":"iter_swap","note":"swaps the values referenced by two dereferenceable objects"},{"label":"iter_move","note":"casts the result of dereferencing the underlying iterator to its associated rvalue reference type"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":224,"codeBlockCount":2}
